            "sid": "2SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa ĩtina wa myaka ĩlĩ mĩima, Avisalomu aĩ na atili ma w’ĩa wa malondu ku Mbaali‐asoli, ĩla yĩ ũtee wa Evalaimu: na Avisalomu eeta ana onthe ma mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
